Free as Air Licence

For humans

Everything here - the paintings, the generative works, the essays, the code,
and every reproduction and document - is free as air.

Copy it, reproduce it, print it, republish it, modify it, translate it, build on
it, sell it, give it away, in whole or in part, by any means, for any purpose.
No permission, no payment, no restriction, no attribution required.

There is no copyright. Nothing is reserved. Nothing is owed.

The source, emptyname.org, may travel with the work, so anyone who meets a copy
can find its way home. Keep it or don't. The freedom is the same either way.

The licence is the stance made literal: the work is let go.

